flowchart TD
    PR[同仓库、非草稿 PR] --> PR_CI[OpenClaw CI lanes]
    PR_CI --> PR_GATE[openclaw/ci-gate]
    PR_GATE --> QA[Codex QA]
    QA --> REVIEW[Codex Review]
    REVIEW --> MERGE[Merge gate]
    MERGE --> PR_DONE[CI 完成]
    PR_DONE --> LEDGER[Quality Ledger]
    LEDGER --> COMMENT[更新 PR 评论]
    LEDGER --> ISSUE[为 QA 缺陷创建 Issue]
    LEDGER --> RECORD[创建或更新质量记录 PR]
    MAIN[push main / 手动运行] --> MAIN_CI[OpenClaw CI lanes]
    MAIN_CI --> MAIN_GATE[openclaw/ci-gate]
    MAIN_GATE --> MAIN_DONE[CI 完成；不发布 Ledger]
